# Organizational Announcement: Digital Solutions Division

**Document Type:** Organizational Announcement
**Authority Level:** 1 (Authoritative)
**From:** Dr. Victoria Chen, CEO
**To:** All Employees
**Date:** January 10, 2026
**Subject:** New Leadership and Organizational Structure for Digital Solutions
**Classification:** Internal

