## Leadership Transition

I am pleased to announce that **Robert Kim** has been appointed **President of Nexus Digital Solutions**, effective January 15, 2026. Robert succeeds Thomas Anderson, who is stepping down for personal health reasons after 15 years of distinguished service.

Robert joined Nexus in 2018 as VP of Engineering and has served as Chief Information Security Officer since 2021. Under his leadership, we achieved SOC 2 Type II certification, launched CyberShield, and built world-class security operations. He holds a Ph.D. in Computer Science from Stanford and an MBA from Wharton.

Please join me in congratulating Robert on this well-deserved promotion.

## Organizational Changes

To support our ambitious growth plans, we are implementing the following organizational changes within Digital Solutions:

### New Leadership Team

| Role | Name | Previous Role |
|------|------|---------------|
| President | Robert Kim | CISO |
| VP Engineering | Dr. Alan Chen | VP Platform Engineering |
| VP Product | Michelle Torres | Sr. Director Product |
| VP Sales | Steven Park | No change |
| VP Customer Success | David Lee | No change |
| CISO (New) | Jennifer Walsh | Director Security Operations |
| VP Finance | Jennifer Adams | Controller, Digital |

### New Business Units

To better serve our markets, Digital Solutions is reorganizing into three business units:

**1. IoT & Edge Computing** (Michelle Torres, acting)
- NexusConnect IoT Platform
- Edge AI Solutions
- Industrial Automation

**2. Cybersecurity** (Jennifer Walsh, acting)
- CyberShield Security Suite
- Security Operations Center
- Threat Intelligence

**3. Quantum Computing** (Dr. Michael Foster)
- QuantumLeap Computing Services
- Quantum Algorithm Development
- Research Partnerships

### Hiring Plans

To support our growth, Digital Solutions will add 450 new positions in FY2026:
- Software Engineering: 200
- Security Operations: 85
- Sales & Marketing: 80
- Customer Success: 50
- Product Management: 35

## Transition Support

Thomas Anderson will remain available as a consultant through March 2026 to ensure a smooth transition. We deeply appreciate Thomas's leadership over the past 15 years and wish him all the best in his recovery.

